 414            /CIF TEST, CHECKS THE ABILITY OF A CIF-ION-NOP-JMP OR
 415                    /CIF-ION-NOP-JMS SEQUENCE TO DO THE FOLLOWING:
 416                            /1.  CIF ENABLE MB TO IB TRANSFER.
 417                            /2.  INHIBIT INTERRUPT TIL JMP OR JMS EXECUTED.
 418                            /3.  INTERRUPT AFTER JMP OR JMS EXECUTED.
 419                            /4.  JMP OR JMS ENABLES IB TO IF TRANSFER.
 420                            /5.  INTERRUPT ENABLES IF TO SF TRANSFER.
 421            
